safix::field_unsupported

  × the mapping declares the field 'tags', and keepassxc cannot carry it. The
  │ store's own command has no way to write that field, so nothing was
  │ written:
  │ accepting the declaration would mean converging a mapping while doing less
  │ than it says.
  │ 
  │ Remove the field from the mapping, or move the mapping to a target whose
  │ own command can write it.
